                   rdfs:label "healthConfirmedBy" .


###  https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#healthInfluencesBehaviourState
:healthInfluencesBehaviourState rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                owl:inverseOf :isInfluencedByHealthCondition ;
                                rdfs:domain :HealthCondition ;
                                rdfs:range :BehaviourState ;
                                rdfs:comment "healthCondition Influences some Livestock BehaviourState" ;
                                rdfs:label "healthInfluencesBehaviourState" .


